	(text "CMS-012 | MECHANICAL CARD DETECT\nMP2/MP4 open without card; closed with card. Independent of card VDD.\nR72=10k: 9801..10201 ohm; R73=1k: 980.1..1020.1 ohm (1% + 100C TCR).\nScreen: VCC=3.0..3.6V; I_leak=2.1uA; contact Rc=0.14 ohm (qualification assumption).\nVhigh=VCC-I_leak*(R72+R73) >=2.976435V.\nVlow=VCC*Rc/(R72+Rc)+I_leak*(R73+R72||Rc) <=0.002194V.\nCorrelated 0.8/0.2 VCC logic margins >=0.576435/0.597814V.\nHeld contact current 291.984..369.410uA; R72 power <1.323mW.\nHirose 1mA is a resistance test, not a proven wetting minimum.\nNo filter capacitor. P406 input-only/pulls off; >=20ms stable debounce REQUIRED.\nWetting, ESD and fault-slew qualification OPEN; SD power/data integrated, qualification pending.\nFull Python-verified calculations: CMS-012 in camera_storage_interfaces.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 253.746 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-012-independent-mechanical-microsd-card-detect")
		)
		(uuid "1f718b83-23fd-4e36-9330-5d027d5d3684")
	)
	(text "SD-003 | MAIN LOAD / RESET FANOUT\nMain=.750+.505+.250+.250+.050+.250+.020=2.075A.\n2.070A only if existing 50mA already includes radio 5mA.\nAt Vin 3.2V / assumed 75% efficiency / Vout 3.393012V:\nIin=2.933542A; converter loss=2.346834W; thermal/source OPEN.\nSD adds 10.6uF main and 22.1uF switched, plus card.\nRST-002: U19 adds 5uA; devices 17uA+overhead 13uA=30uA.\nReset sink=.376190mA<.4mA; high>=2.845789V.\nAllocation/conditional math only; firmware and bench acceptance OPEN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.862 260.604 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/microsd_power_interface.md")
		)
		(uuid "44df7d5c-0e68-46c0-b5e0-9b7d0d7ae22d")
	)
	(text "SD-001 | POWER / READY / GATES\nU17 ILIM: R76=2.21k; TI row .38/.50/.62A min/typ/max.\nCard+support=.270A; Vmin=3.151820-.270*(.116+.100)\n=3.093500V > G30 rise screen 2.902647V; CT open 12..28ms.\nFLT reports thermal/reverse, not current limiting alone.\nU19 ANDs request/reset; U20 ANDs IO request/READY.\nON-low load<=3.6/70k+.1/9801+12uA=73.632uA<100uA.\nGate VOL<=.1V (VCC 1.65..5.5V) < ON VIL .35V.\nConditional DC screens; startup/collapse qualification OPEN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 202.946 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/microsd_power_interface.md")
		)
		(uuid "498607d7-0ad5-403b-a5cb-0bc743591ff7")
	)
	(text "SD-002 | DISCHARGE / ISOLATION\nR82=330R; Rmax=330*1.01*1.02; Cisland<=40.4865uF.\nRequire cutoff+isolation<=10ms and total return<=20uA.\nVinf=20uA*Rmax; t=.010+Rmax*C*ln((3.6-Vinf)/(.3-Vinf))\n=44.491861ms; require >=50ms before repowering.\nIO request OFF; wait>=1us at valid main; then power OFF.\nNo reliance on QOD at zero VIN. Capacitance/return bounds\nrequire measurement; no arbitrary-fault or data-integrity proof."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 254 229.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/microsd_power_interface.md")
		)
		(uuid "9c1c6ec5-7f57-4cf5-8abf-cabdc6dc3ff0")
	)
